{"Title":"An Act relative to a certain road in the city of Boston","BillNumber":"H3335","DocketNumber":"HD3226","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"REH1","Name":"Russell E. Holmes","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/REH1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T11:05:34.333"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"REH1","Name":"Russell E. Holmes","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/REH1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T11:05:34.3333333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3335/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Holmes of Boston, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3335) of Russell E. Holmes relative to changing the name of the American Legion highway to the American Legion parkway.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Notwithstanding any general or special law to the contrary, the city of Boston shall change the name of the American Legion Highway, a road in the city that connects Hyde Park avenue with Blue Hill Avenue, to American Legion Parkway. The city shall erect and maintain suitable markers bearing the name.\r\n\tSECTION 2. This act shall take effect upon its passage.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}